      "prompt": "You are a design systems lead creating a customizable booking widget. Design: 1) A design token system that allows any brand customization, 2) Component library with 50+ booking-specific components, 3) Theme system for light/dark/brand modes, 4) Animation library for delightful micro-interactions, 5) Accessibility system beyond WCAG. Include Figma library and CSS architecture.",
